    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Death Delivery</strong><br>Death Delivery is a 40 minute - 1 hour long horror game where you deliver packages to doorsteps. However, it appears you're not alone. <br><br><strong>Gameplay</strong><br>This game is fundamentally a &quot;Walking Simulator&quot; with elements of driving (i.e the delivery truck.)<br><br><strong>Key Features\u00a0 <br></strong>Take pictures of the packages to confirm delivery.<br><br>Ring doorbells to notify customers<br><br>Drive around in a &quot;Fed-Ups&quot; truck to deliver.<br><br>You're <span class=\"bb_strike\"><u>being stalked. </u></span>\u00a0<span class=\"bb_strike\"><u></u></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\"><u></u></span><strong>Controls <br></strong>W,A,S,D - Movement <br>E - Interact<br>Q - Drop Item<br>F - Toggle Phone<br>LMB - Take Picture<strong></strong></p>",
